{"id":"n92042-4-7","stage":4,"title":"훌쩍 · 马上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92042-4-7-1","ko":"소식 들었어? 김 과장이 지난 주에 회사 그만두었대.","zh":"听说了吗？金科长上周辞职了哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소식","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}},{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"과장이","meaning":"科长","explanation":"과장：科长；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"과장","audio":"/audio/0a0f863c306652467c16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18293","senseId":"1","lemma":"과장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과장이","audio":"/audio/79bb50806c05ed210555.mp3"}},{"text":"지난","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"주에","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"주：一周，一星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26897","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에","audio":"/audio/28e7aef02277c8ef3bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두었대.","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두었대","audio":"/audio/d449c36dc2c3b313d740.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"71143","definition":"告知远方的人或不常见的人的情况或状况的话或文字。","pronunciation":["소식"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"0a0f863c30665246","term":"과장","zh":"科长","audio":"/audio/0a0f863c306652467c16.mp3","entryId":"18293","definition":"在机关或公司等里的一个科室的负责人。","pronunciation":["과장"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"26897","definition":"周一到周日的七天时间。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/32c400d25143053cc6b2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92042-4-7-2","ko":"어머, 너무한다. 그렇게 말도 없이 훌쩍 가다니.",